{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"34a253976200d782","__entryId":"transition","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding-bottom:24px\">写下你的想法…</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-text\">取消</button>\n          <span style=\"position:relative\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(99,102,241,.35)\">发布</button>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:-6px;bottom:-12px;font-size:13px\">🖱️</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--bg-hover);border:1px solid var(--border)\"></span>\n        <span>→</span>\n        <span style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--brand)\"></span>\n        <code style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">transition: background .25s ease</code>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">新消息提醒</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:3px;top:8px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:18px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">每周精选邮件</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:18px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">深色模式</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:#c9cdd4\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:2px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:10px\">滑块通过 transform 平移；左侧残影表示运动轨迹</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:8px\">\n        <div style=\"width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-workspace.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">官网改版</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">昨天更新</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:relative;width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-mountain.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">徒步相册</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 小时前</div></div>\n          <span style=\"position:absolute;right:4px;bottom:2px;font-size:12px\">🖱️</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">团建报名</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">3 天前</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">悬停时用 transform 与阴影提供过渡反馈，移开后平滑回落</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:40%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:230px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px\">确认退出登录？</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:10px\">未保存的草稿会自动保留。</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">退出</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        弹窗与遮罩 opacity\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);opacity:.15\"></span>\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);opacity:.5\"></span>\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand)\"></span>\n        以 opacity 平滑过渡\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding-bottom:24px\">Write your thoughts…</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-text\">Cancel</button>\n          <span style=\"position:relative\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(99,102,241,.35)\">Publish</button>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:-6px;bottom:-12px;font-size:13px\">🖱️</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--bg-hover);border:1px solid var(--border)\"></span>\n        <span>→</span>\n        <span style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--brand)\"></span>\n        <code style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">transition: background .25s ease</code>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">New message alerts</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:3px;top:8px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:18px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Weekly digest email</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:18px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Dark mode</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:#c9cdd4\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:2px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:10px\">The knob uses a transform transition; the ghost on the left shows its path</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:8px\">\n        <div style=\"width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-workspace.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Website Redesign</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Updated yesterday</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:relative;width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-mountain.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Hiking Album</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 hours ago</div></div>\n          <span style=\"position:absolute;right:4px;bottom:2px;font-size:12px\">🖱️</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Team Offsite RSVP</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">3 days ago</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">Transform and shadow provide the hover feedback, then settle smoothly on exit</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:40%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:230px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px\">Log out?</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:10px\">Unsaved drafts are kept automatically.</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Log out</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        Modal and mask opacity\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);opacity:.15\"></span>\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);opacity:.5\"></span>\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand)\"></span>\n        ease with opacity\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"trans-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><span class=\"trans-anat-state\"><i class=\"trans-anat-s\">默认</i><i class=\"trans-anat-arr\">→</i><i class=\"trans-anat-on\">悬停</i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"property\"><span class=\"trans-anat-tag\">transition-property: background</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"duration\"><span class=\"trans-anat-tag\">transition-duration: .25s</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"easing\"><span class=\"trans-anat-tag\">transition-timing-function: ease-out</span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"trans-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><span class=\"trans-anat-state\"><i class=\"trans-anat-s\">Default</i><i class=\"trans-anat-arr\">→</i><i class=\"trans-anat-on\">Hover</i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"property\"><span class=\"trans-anat-tag\">transition-property: background</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"duration\"><span class=\"trans-anat-tag\">transition-duration: .25s</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"easing\"><span class=\"trans-anat-tag\">transition-timing-function: ease-out</span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"trigger","cn":"状态变化","en":"Trigger","desc":"悬停、选中等状态切换，是过渡的起点","desc_en":"A state change like hover or selection — the starting point of every transition"},{"key":"property","cn":"过渡属性","en":"Property","desc":"明确列出需要过渡的属性，避免用 all 意外影响其他变化","desc_en":"List the properties that should transition; avoid all when unrelated changes may be animated"},{"key":"duration","cn":"时长","en":"Duration","desc":"变化持续多久；按距离、任务和减少动态效果偏好测试","desc_en":"How long it takes; test against distance, task, and motion preferences"},{"key":"easing","cn":"缓动","en":"Easing","desc":"时间曲线函数，控制属性渐变的速度分布","desc_en":"The speed curve that gives the motion its character"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"颜色过渡","en":"Color","demo":"<span class=\"trans-v-row\"><i class=\"trans-v-chip\"></i><span class=\"trans-v-arr\">→</span><i class=\"trans-v-on\"></i></span>","when":"悬停变色、选中态切换","when_en":"Hover color shifts and selected states"},{"cn":"变换过渡","en":"Transform","demo":"<span class=\"trans-v-card\">浮起</span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"trans-v-card\">Lift</span>","when":"浮起滑入用 transform，性能最好","when_en":"Lifts and slide-ins via transform — best performance"},{"cn":"透明度过渡","en":"Opacity","demo":"<span class=\"trans-v-row\"><i class=\"trans-v-o1\"></i><i class=\"trans-v-o2\"></i><i class=\"trans-v-on\"></i></span>","when":"淡入淡出的入场与退场","when_en":"Fade-in entrances and fade-out exits"}],"use":[{"t":"让按钮和链接的悬停颜色平滑变化","m":"trans-hover"},{"t":"明确写出变化属性、时长和{c:easing}","m":"trans-recipe"},{"t":"<b>按距离与任务设时长</b>：短反馈通常更快，较大的空间移动可能更久；不要套用固定时长","m":"trans-timing"},{"t":"优先过渡 transform 和{c:opacity}等流畅属性","m":"trans-fade"}],"dont":[{"t":"不要默认使用 transition: all，以免无关属性也产生动画","m":"trans-all","bad":true},{"t":"时长与任务不匹配：<b>过长会拖慢反馈，过短会掩盖变化</b>；按内容、距离和减少动态效果偏好验证","m":"trans-slow","bad":true},{"t":"未设置 transition：颜色会<b>直接切换</b>，缺少状态变化反馈","m":"trans-jump","bad":true},{"t":"谨慎过渡宽高，位移和缩放优先使用 transform","m":"trans-layout","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"开关的滑块只需要在开和关两个位置之间平滑移动。怎样实现更合适？","options":[{"id":"explicit-transition","label":"只给 transform 设置短过渡，并处理减少动态效果偏好","feedback":"变化只有明确的起点和终点；限定属性能避免无关样式被动画，并尊重用户的动态偏好。","correct":true},{"id":"transition-all","label":"给整个开关设置 transition: all，持续一秒","feedback":"all 会让未来新增的颜色、尺寸等属性意外参与动画，一秒也会拖慢即时操作反馈。","correct":false},{"id":"paired-keyframes","label":"分别写“打开”和“关闭”两套关键帧，再按状态播放","feedback":"关键帧能实现运动，但两套方向要重复维护；已有起点和终点时，过渡更直接。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A switch thumb only needs to move smoothly between its on and off positions. Which implementation fits best?","options":[{"id":"explicit-transition","label":"Apply a short transition only to transform and respect reduced-motion preferences","feedback":"The change has clear start and end states. Limiting the property avoids animating unrelated styles and respects motion preferences.","correct":true},{"id":"transition-all","label":"Set transition: all on the whole switch for one second","feedback":"The all keyword can animate future color or size changes unintentionally, and one second slows direct feedback.","correct":false},{"id":"paired-keyframes","label":"Write separate Open and Close keyframes and choose one for each state","feedback":"Keyframes can move the thumb, but two directions duplicate maintenance when a transition already connects the current and next states.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请让开关滑块用短 transition 在两个位置间移动，只声明需要变化的 transform 和颜色，不要使用 transition: all。为减少动态效果偏好关闭非必要运动，并验证快速连续切换时状态不会错乱。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Move the switch thumb between its two positions with a short transition that names only transform and color, not transition: all. Remove nonessential motion for reduced-motion preferences and verify rapid toggling keeps the correct state."}},"references":[{"title":"transition 属性","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/transition","title_en":"transition"}],"scenes":["按钮悬停变色","开关拨动滑移","卡片悬停浮起","弹窗淡入淡出"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Hover and focus feedback","m":"trans-hover"},{"t":"Open or close a small panel","m":"trans-recipe"},{"t":"Change color, opacity, or transform","m":"trans-timing"},{"t":"Help people follow a state change","m":"trans-fade"}],"dont":[{"t":"Animate every property with one broad rule","m":"trans-all","bad":true},{"t":"Use a long transition for frequent controls","m":"trans-slow","bad":true},{"t":"Animate layout-heavy properties without checking performance","m":"trans-jump","bad":true},{"t":"Ignore reduced-motion settings","m":"trans-layout","bad":true}],"scenes":["Button hover","Dropdown opening","Accordion","Theme change"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding-bottom:24px\">Write your thoughts…</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-text\">Cancel</button>\n          <span style=\"position:relative\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(99,102,241,.35)\">Publish</button>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:-6px;bottom:-12px;font-size:13px\">🖱️</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--bg-hover);border:1px solid var(--border)\"></span>\n        <span>→</span>\n        <span style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--brand)\"></span>\n        <code style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace\">transition: background .25s ease</code>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">New message alerts</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:3px;top:8px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:18px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Weekly digest email</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:18px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Dark mode</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:#c9cdd4\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:2px;top:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:10px\">The knob uses a transform transition; the ghost on the left shows its path</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:8px\">\n        <div style=\"width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-workspace.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Website Redesign</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Updated yesterday</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:relative;width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-mountain.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Hiking Album</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 hours ago</div></div>\n          <span style=\"position:absolute;right:4px;bottom:2px;font-size:12px\">🖱️</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:104px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Team Offsite RSVP</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">3 days ago</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">Transform and shadow provide the hover feedback, then settle smoothly on exit</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:40%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:230px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px\">Log out?</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:10px\">Unsaved drafts are kept automatically.</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Log out</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        Modal and mask opacity\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);opacity:.15\"></span>\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);opacity:.5\"></span>\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand)\"></span>\n        ease with opacity\n      </div>\n    </div>"]},"usageMocks":{"trans-hover":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">保存</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">保存</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">悬停时颜色渐变过去，不是跳变</span>","trans-recipe":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">transition-property: background</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">transition-duration: .25s</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">transition-timing-function: ease-out</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">明确属性、时长和缓动曲线</span>","trans-timing":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">短反馈</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">按距离测试</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">较大位移</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">时长由距离、任务和减少动态效果偏好决定</span>","trans-fade":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:16px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:3px;opacity:.08\"></span><span style=\"width:22px;height:16px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:3px;opacity:.35\"></span><span style=\"width:22px;height:16px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:3px;opacity:.65\"></span><span style=\"width:22px;height:16px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">opacity 与 transform 通常能避免布局变化</span>","trans-all":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-tag red\">transition: all</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">连 width、padding 的意外变化也被动画</span></div>","trans-slow":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">hover</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i style=\"width:18%\"></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">变色过渡过长，会让反馈显得迟缓</span></div>","trans-jump":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:24px;height:18px;background:#e5e6eb;border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">⚡</span><span style=\"width:24px;height:18px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">未设置 transition，颜色直接切换</span>","trans-layout":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:flex-end\"><span style=\"width:34px;height:14px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span style=\"width:60px;height:26px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">过渡 width/height 会触发重排，卡</span></div>"}}}